{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04084","headline":"闲园即事寄韦侍郎 · 苏頲","name":"闲园即事寄韦侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结庐东城下，直望江南山。\n青霭远相接，白云来复还。\n拂筵红藓上，开幔绿条间。\n物应春偏好，情忘趣转闲。\n宪臣饶美度，联事惜徂颜。\n有酒空盈酌，高车不可攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}